question:
다음 SQL 문과 질의에 대한 결과 값으로 맞는 것은?

[테이블 생성 및 데이터 입력]
CREATE TABLE TEST(A INTEGER, B VARCHAR(10));
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (1, 'kim');
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (2, ' ');
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (3, NULL);
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (4, 'park');
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (5, NULL);
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (6, 'lee');

[Oracle DBMS의 SQL]
```sql
SELECT X, X-Y, Z
FROM (
  SELECT COUNT(*) AS X,
         COUNT(B) AS Y,
         COUNT(CASE WHEN B IS NOT NULL
                     AND LTRIM(B) IS NULL
                    THEN '1' END) AS Z
  FROM TEST
) T;

```

[SQL Server DBMS의 SQL]
```sql
SELECT X, X-Y, Z
FROM (
  SELECT COUNT(*) AS X,
         COUNT(B) AS Y,
         COUNT(CASE WHEN B IS NOT NULL
                     AND LEN(LTRIM(B)) = 0
                    THEN '1' END) AS Z
  FROM TEST
) T;
```
